# Data and privacy

- Read ADR-0001, ADR-0006, and ADR-0007.
- Keep demo and personal containers isolated.
- Preserve missing values as nil; separate facts, AI observations, and derived metrics.
- Derive volume from complete records and calories from the deterministic MET service.
- Normalize external data into Soma models before statistics.
- Store per-space/source/stream cursors, external IDs, and source deletions.
- Keep original media in the sandbox; tests and screenshots use only `DemoMedia`.
- Never log or commit real body photos, health history, API keys, certificates, or complete traces.
- Deletion must remove dependent media/equipment without leaving invalid current-gym state.
